  "notes": [
    "The raw Born JSONL files are byte-identical for both component controls and the baseline.",
    "All CDF means reproduce the existing controls.csv to absolute precision better than1e-14.",
    "Common-cut ratios are auxiliary and must not be quoted as actual-real-bin ratios.",
    "Component estimates use500 Born-cluster bootstrap resamples; different q values are correlated.",
    "Mean fullDelta is not the product of component means because Born-dependent factors are correlated.",
    "The original actual-real errors listed here were copied from its500-resample paired analysis.",
    "Equality to the complete shower is a diagnostic target, not an exact theorem for the approximate Delta construction.",
    "Matching historical shower couplings changes emission rates; known version, PDF and massive-top/table conventions remain distinct issues."
